<p>This is the proof that the milk meme has been dried up.</p>
<p>First we had SCP-3739, an excellent article tying pataphysics, broken masquerade, milk and horror.</p>
<p>Second we had SCP-4475. While I like seeing fifthism and ortothan mythos, this felt like 3739&#160;2: Honey Edition IN SPACE. Also, the sister article is better for me.</p>
<p>And we have SCP-4487, which is the combination of a superficial reading of 3739 and trying to rewrite a coldpost. It's true that now this is nearer to a proper SCP than the prior coldpost, but the format screw <em>the Ecto department</em>, the predictable and a bit of cartoonish made me downvote.</p>
<p>Nice CSS theme</p>

